WEBVTT

00:25:57.316 --> 00:26:01.196
and your thinking
as a reporter, a journalist.

00:26:01.236 --> 00:26:03.596
How would you say reporting
on conflict and crisis

00:26:03.596 --> 00:26:06.076
has changed the way
you think about the world,

00:26:06.116 --> 00:26:07.716
your perspective on life?

00:26:09.156 --> 00:26:13.356
CA: I think it's changed my perspective

00:26:13.396 --> 00:26:17.516
in that I'm very clear
that I can't be a both-siderism,

00:26:17.516 --> 00:26:20.236
or “on the one hand/on the otherism.”

00:26:20.276 --> 00:26:22.756
In other words, in certain instances,

00:26:22.756 --> 00:26:26.756
such as gross violations
of international humanitarian law,

00:26:26.796 --> 00:26:27.996
which we're witnessing,

00:26:28.036 --> 00:26:32.836
in other words, you know,
human rights atrocities,